00:30:46,630 --> 00:30:48,870
In fact,

307
00:30:48,870 --> 00:31:00,549
one of the weirdest trickiest parts is I mentioned that you can run some drivers in wine and those drivers they actually are they think they're running in the Windows kernel which in a sense works the same way.

