00:31:00,549 --> 00:31:07,029
It has libraries that it can load and those drivers are basically libraries and they are making kernel calls

309
00:31:07,029 --> 00:31:17,830
and they're they're making calls into the kernel library that does some very very low-level tasks that you're normally only supposed to be able to do in the kernel.

