00:35:32,310 --> 00:35:35,510
They're just encoded differently.

357
00:35:35,510 --> 00:35:48,630
And again like the way kernel calls are done is on a level just above the kernel where you have a library that just passes things through almost verbatim to the kernel and we implement that library instead.

